- Monitors commits, PRs, and technical achievements\n- Creates automated PRs with proper Docusaurus formatting\n- Configurable activity thresholds and week period overrides\n- Comprehensive documentation for setup and customization\n\nFeatures:\n- Repository activity analysis and metrics collection\n- Claude AI integration for high-quality content generation\n- Automated PR creation with detailed summaries\n- Contributor highlighting and achievement recognition\n- Technical insights and architectural learnings\n- Community impact assessment and forward-looking content\n- SEO-optimized blog post formatting for Docusaurus\n\nSetup requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret for Claude AI integration.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccec42938cd6375a083382ac555a44fc7095c299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/toplocs-workspace/git/trees/ccec42938cd6375a083382ac555a44fc7095c299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/toplocs-workspace/git/commits/2cff0f053c29379392499ffa12725f3964d5a810","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1204907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felixboehm","id":1204907,"login":"felixboehm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDQ5MDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/starred{/owner}{/rep