 accurate name reflecting Claude AI integration\n\n### ⏰ Nightly Automation\n- Added cron schedule: runs automatically every night at 3 AM UTC\n- Keeps documentation continuously updated with ecosystem changes\n- Reduces manual maintenance overhead\n\n### 🌙 Enhanced UX for Scheduled Runs\n- Different commit messages for nightly vs manual runs\n- Different PR titles with moon emoji for nightly runs\n- Specialized PR body explaining automated sync process\n- Context-aware output messages for better monitoring\n\n### 📋 Smart Messaging\n- Nightly runs show \"😴 No changes needed\" vs \"🌙 Proceeding with analysis\"\n- Manual runs retain original messaging\n- Better user experience for different trigger types\n\n### 🤖 Maintained Functionality\n- All existing manual trigger options preserved\n- Claude AI integration unchanged\n- Repository analysis and intelligent updates work identically\n- Backward compatible with existing workflow usage\n\nThe workflow now runs automatically every night while maintaining full manual control when needed.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca1a0b546f9dfc3f382d1b8b31c0b9f90e2dc5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/toplocs-workspace/git/trees/ca1a0b546f9dfc3f382d1b8b31c0b9f90e2dc5f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/toplocs-workspace/git/commits/0b4c64d6548954a85ef5761c7f74836e490254e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1204907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixboehm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felixboehm","id":1204907,"logi