sting strategy with Jest, Playwright, and custom API testing utilities\n- Built automated integration test runner for frontend-backend compatibility\n- Added E2E tests for cross-browser compatibility and user workflows\n- Implemented performance monitoring and error scenario testing\n- Created detailed documentation for development, testing, and deployment\n- Added setup scripts and development utilities for easy onboarding\n- Configured CI/CD ready testing pipeline with detailed reporting","tree":{"sha":"4c07ccc07359787efbfc40d71e854f087b7793a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/git/trees/4c07ccc07359787efbfc40d71e854f087b7793a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/git/commits/c6126bfb2f6b5259fee2959285af320f21b88af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/commit/c6126bfb2f6b5259fee2959285af320f21b88af4","node_id":"C_kwDOPHqc29oAKGM2MTI2YmZiMmY2YjUyNTlmZWUyOTU5Mjg1YWYzMjBmMjFiODhhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/commit/1fbcb9828e75b70586766c8b24a37e5daecf81e7","sha":"1fbcb9828e75b70586766c8b24a37e5daecf81e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/commits/1fbcb9828e75b70586766c8b24a37e5daecf81e7"}],"sha":"c6126bfb2f6b5259fee2959285af320f21b88af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/commits/c6126bfb2f6b5259fee2959285af320f21b88af4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomascarter613/ultimate-paas-frontend/commits/1fbcb9828e75b70586766c8b24a37e5daecf81e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-06T07:08:10Z","email":"thomas.carter@appliedinnovationcorp.com","name":"Thomas Carter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-06T07:08:10Z","email":"thomas.carter@appliedinnovationc