 be updated together.\n\nUpdates `react` from 19.2.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/react/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/react/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/react/react/commits/v19.3.0/packages/react)\n\nUpdates `@types/react` from 19.1.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@types/react\"\n  dependency-version: 19.3.0\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n- dependency-name: react\n  dependency-version: 19.3.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(deps): bump react-dom to 19.3.0 to match react\n\nReact requires react and react-dom to be the exact same version; the react-only bump made the test suite fail at import time.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tiago Vilas Boas <tcarvalhovb@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"daafc230e3da5d6e938dda7a8bd64dcc606bff5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiagovilasboas/react-vite-boilerplate/git/trees/daafc230e3da5d6e938dda7a8bd64dcc606bff5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiagovilasboas/react-vite-boilerplate/git/commits/a6c6072b63e094db30ef86077443f951aa4896fc","verification":{"payload":"tree daafc230e3da5d6e938dda7a8bd64dcc606bff5d\nparent 5cfffa86196b701c7b49fe10173b0350ca382d33\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791000431 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791000431 -0300\n\nchore(deps): bump react, react-dom and @types/react to 19.3.0 (#14)\n\n* chore(deps): bump react and @types/react\n\nBumps [react](https://github.com/react/react/tree/HEAD/packages/react) and [@types/react](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/react). These dependencies needed to be updated together.\n\nUpdates `react` from 19.2.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/react/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/react/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/react/react/commits/v19.3.0/packages/react)\n\nUpdates `@types/react` from 19.1.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@types/react\"\n  dependency-version: 19.3.0\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n- dependency-name: react\n  dependency-version: 19.3.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(deps): bump react-dom to 19.3.0 to match react\n\nReact requires react and react-dom to be the exact same version; the react-only bump made the test suite fail at import time.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tiago Vilas Boas <tcarvalhovb@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwH9vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJFAQAGU4TCfWQZic6QYeHjC6siFj\n5cGctaUq71JB2qIMz3kiDVmb+L5bVbhLwvOXOd5Avl3G5y2uQ+gYvA++d4oeMVg6\nfWKUPB4FS/3zTNm3lsPkpvu1GPZT6zqv9A3OEMO6gYQy4W+Oi5G/4Sc/INJ3PkUc\nRYIhYMxTxVE5ulyxRsUsDJgB1JiXDGUZqY8j48PlQDW74U7/m5hFyAKvLfhYfzWA\nzv4/l1Djz5JG/B4DRyebBF/mFiOFC3qpDWwl4k/8kj9BcFBlZejSCCmQWnttf6jA\nxNipXtIkf3qOG68bwMOztOYhTIdfQ0Bg10EOt4ihJ7Xu1z9auzTIP8R7VGvVUeG7\nudlKCIpA7Gupyg8Dj8Deso2aWpnkr3Tv01MaY4dt4bithyoTxCY4rb8nRzFZBRmV\nVbSUQZ73LgSt9zFwi3hEmrQQA6hXqHdEme2ai0X9ULz51IGNotrliyO