.0.1\n\nBumps [@eslint/js](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/tree/HEAD/packages/js) from 9.30.1 to 10.0.1.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commits/v10.0.1/packages/js)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@eslint/js\"\n  dependency-version: 10.0.1\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: complete ESLint 10 upgrade for @eslint/js 10\n\nBump eslint to 10 and typescript-eslint to 8.69+, enable @eslint/js\nrecommended, and update formatjs/react-hooks for ESLint 10. Pin the\nReact version in ESLint settings so eslint-plugin-react does not call\nremoved context.getFilename(). Add .npmrc legacy-peer-deps because\njsx-a11y/react plugins still declare ESLint 9 peers, and add\n@testing-library/dom so npm ci satisfies Testing Library.\n\nCo-authored-by: Tiago Vilas Boas <tcarvalhovb@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tiago Vilas Boas <tcarvalhovb@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f59d25cdfd56d574aba180a0c14adae2495aae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiagovilasboas/react-vite-boilerplate/git/trees/9f59d25cdfd56d574aba180a0c14adae2495aae0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiagovilasboas/react-vite-boilerplate/git/commits/b07aa110506e7e2fd1b9c1aa8ce2ba5cf451ec9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_