events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giesela-Bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giesela-Bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giesela-Bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giesela-Bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/commits/1959c870d0bbbdd42cc441b755d8230154ef0266/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:52Z","email":"mail+giesela@janjaap.de","name":"Giesela-Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(billing): widen transaction modal and show real kWh/rate for energy items (#1902)\n\n* fix(billing): widen transaction modal and show real kWh/rate for energy items (ATT-1103)\n\nThe billing transaction modal was too narrow for its item table, and energy\nline items displayed a misleading quantity of 1 and a unit price equal to\nthe total charge instead of the actual kWh consumed and per-kWh rate.\n\n* fix(billing): use BigInt for microWh->kWh conversion to avoid precision loss (ATT-1103)\n\nNumber(item.energyMicroWh) rounds before dividing, which silently corrupts\nthe displayed kWh figure for very large energy readings even though the API\nsends energyMicroWh as a string specifically to allow arbitrary-size values.\nDo the division with BigInt so only the small, already-safe quotient is\ncoerced to Number for display.\n\nAddresses Sourcery review finding on PR #1902.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Giesela-Bot <289833043+Giesela-Bot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b75121a3398f8e2eee15a6fc757d88535e3d2357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/git/trees/b75121a3398f8e2eee15a6fc757d88535e3d2357"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/git/commits/1959c870d0bbbdd42cc441b755d8230154ef0266","verification":{"payload":"tree b75121a3398f8e2eee15a6fc757d88535e3d2357\nparent 147856b1289e0283fb67a22c7f058060b5757dd3\nauthor Giesela-Bot <mail+giesela@janjaap.de> 1790760232 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790760232 +0000\n\nfix(billing): widen transaction modal and show real kWh/rate for energy items (#1902)\n\n* fix(billing): widen transaction modal and show real kWh/rate for energy items (ATT-1103)\n\nThe billing transaction modal was too narrow for its item table, and energy\nline items displayed a misleading quantity of 1 and a unit price equal to\nthe total charge instead of the actual kWh consumed and per-kWh rate.\n\n* fix(billing): use BigInt for microWh->kWh conversion to avoid precision loss (ATT-1103)\n\nNumber(item.energyMicroWh) rounds before dividing, which silently corrupts\nthe displayed kWh figure for very large energy readings even though the API\nsends energyMicroWh as a string specifically to allow arbitrary-size values.\nDo the division with BigInt so only the small, already-safe quotient is\ncoerced to Number for display.\n\nAddresses Sourcery review finding on PR #1902.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Giesela-Bot <289833043+Giesela-Bot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvNU4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN54QADB3rRsaBvqO8Vasb7jsC3l4\naHR2yDt/J2zV9F7XaRC3bc27M30xLM7FxrApV+GUP0vmHIBA6JePjjbHA0QzWobX\npyfIXJNlHc2jxW7RRuf5QITm19DQ6PCBqkpvDx2s+wAxKt0Sjs1D8LobOPtJOas2\nBlmLUzQUsCy0lLn0KBhn2wZYmfflGTEfkiIvO7C5GmxbhmHIB+RgLVNZNWeyp+hy\nbjQefD4jgtwXzBUOPG3DBwfqCNh+rLkqREy+mPD/AMKmeQQkKbPWFbR1gYJh1MN/\nUcyHmQSDj+qY0Ot3HsxV+zYTwTRpt0qYv5diejTip4bMvWpr9OrW8/dbLy8eGbwQ\n5wirmdqW0r9lMMorKGQm4UDoESWBJOv7XwQ7sZcdK9BQKw8eWwhcpsJOZsm9UYz7\nUCwrD7D2AXoGqPYR756++5l0dIcuheKQH3TuwEXtvR6EjA+AxHDwecOiKipekrY4\n7J8k88slZH89Ca6XUR3PQ3Jn8r3W9leojLhEoZDfii00G7SQB8qk6P6IrwppLtMn\ngrmpn83n5JALsfrcXdwpxCl6hM3YiEu01q143dfT8we9Cj4En8BUGmRvOG5vxdNV\n6ePAic6bOuQZALNT+tYVmrH9HraBI3+BuSUCRlC3XdXRKaBaWey7kBX/1WthprD2\nre9B0jUFkeNytQ/IbjPv\n=D2sE\n-----END PGP 