vatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jappyjan","id":10154260,"login":"jappyjan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTU0MjYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jappyjan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/commits/147856b1289e0283fb67a22c7f058060b5757dd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:12:18Z","email":"jappyjan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jan Jaap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:12:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(flows): show plugin-supplied summaries on flow canvas nodes (#1898)\n\n* feat(flows): show plugin-supplied summaries on flow canvas nodes\n\nPlugin nodes can return up to four plain-text `preview` rows from their\nconfig schema; the canvas renders those instead of raw config. WAGO\ncommand/event/read/wait nodes provide device, channel and action/condition\nsummaries. Plugin handles without core translations fall back to their names.\n\nPorted from the preview half of #1890; its billing half is superseded by #1895.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(flows): localize plugin previews and avoid redundant refreshes\n\n* fix(flows): retry failed previews on focus and reconnect\n\n* perf(flows): resolve lightweight previews and refresh applied revisions\n\n* fix(wago): scope preview controller cache by selection\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f05a169d891ba952ff711a111ca5fdd39528fe1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/git/trees/f05a169d891ba952ff711a111ca5fdd39528fe1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Attraccess/Attraccess/git/commits/147856b1289e0283fb67a22c7f058060b5757dd3","verification":{"payload":"tree f05a169d891ba952ff711a111ca5fdd39528fe1e\nparent 2c9f39cded109f19bdc09ccf8b75ed31b2babb02\nauthor Jan Jaap <jappyjan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790712738 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790712738 +0200\n\nfeat(flows): show plugin-supplied summaries on flow canvas nodes (#1898)\n\n* feat(flows): show plugin-supplied summaries on flow canvas nodes\n\nPlugin nodes can return up to four plain-text `preview` rows from their\nconfig schema; the canvas renders those instead of raw config. WAGO\ncommand/event/read/wait nodes provide device, channel and action/condition\nsummaries. Plugin handles without core translations fall back to their names.\n\nPorted from the preview half of #1890; its billing half is superseded by #1895.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(flows): localize plugin previews and avoid redundant refreshes\n\n* fix(flows): retry failed previews on focus and reconnect\n\n* perf(flows): resolve lightweight previews and refresh applied revisions\n\n* fix(wago): scope preview controller cache by selection\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvBujCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArWMQAKxFIwLrZgaiJrcfNz7QYUZD\njLs/Y07IBiGxoqvxG1PeW1OV2VigIVDa5vdD0Xmk4XN6ZD6lX24b/9MN187tG3YN\n4xE1hHe/gWpxiMvnl6AIue9I6qMmjaE8y8OuDpvYpZKumApVoDnSlieJKm81CJPA\nvH+AQMy8nCKrhEDVaFDoFefAtvKZw/BaVI1RBLGmeVbEeNPKq/uFJdAHU6hahYKp\nVP4c6onbn66CGxZo2KH5CkU0ExGwBRE0p+1M9STsj7y0K2Cy01ULasS1NmNS2XiA\noLl2daslce4eARB5oPzZmn/xukghWm+fy+efcNODhGCsStahYdKDWyY5qJs1SruM\nl9RFXbrhIUcU9UrPnPwW1ieOvUVNTjTjQrvuaMXHEMI6IHLEIyEfBZ0Z3xM9Jp1Z\nALyZI2kawqGX7/iHZCZdBSTOAB3PEEg7CZctZ2lZfb3s3LfVujTr9QW0ixhWyNOA\nHA2nyTHrPwwA43cpkA3nAbEP/CYWSztJoQL