tient admission status and related data.\n- Removed redundant EMR configuration checks from components, enhancing code clarity and maintainability.\n\n* Refactor admission encounter logic in useCurrentPatientAdmissionEncounter hook\n\n- Updated the hook to return the latest admission or transfer encounter, improving accuracy in determining patient admission status.\n- Simplified related logic in InpatientDetailView and patient-cells components to utilize the new encounter retrieval method.\n- Added a new translation key for cases when a patient is not currently admitted to the ward, enhancing user feedback.\n\n* Rename tranfer patient action to admit patient for both admission and tranfer\n\n* Fix failing test as a result of action button renaming from transfer to admit patient","tree":{"sha":"7d4f9b5a453606bde3f62046740a3adf234aa26f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omoshlawi/kenyaemr-esm-ward/git/trees/7d4f9b5a453606bde3f62046740a3adf234aa26f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omoshlawi/kenyaemr-esm-ward/git/commits/14e8361d4da81b670cf1bff66bd3126317fdaab9","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d4f9b5a453606bde3f62046740a3adf234aa26f\nparent f89a746b0d31c634ff269832da865686a0de8812\nauthor Laurent Ouma <98098891+Omoshlawi@users.noreply.github.com> 1763721574 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763721574 +0300\n\nFix interward tranfer bug (#30)\n\n* Add useCurrentPatientAdmissionEncounter hook for fetching latest admission encounter\n\n- Introduced a new hook, useCurrentPatientAdmissionEncounter, to fetch the latest admission or transfer encounter for a patient.\n- Updated InpatientDetailView and InpatientForms components to utilize the new hook, simplifying the logic for determining patient admission status and related data.\n- Removed redundant EMR configuration checks from components, enhancing code clarity and maintainability.\n\n* Refactor admission encounter logic in useCurrentPatientAdmissionEncounter hook\n\n- Updated the hook to return the lates